  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758594,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 008 Scanner - Commodore 64\n\nDelve into the neon-drenched world of *008 Scanner*, a thrilling arcade-style action game for the Commodore 64. You pilot a high-tech scanner vehicle through a sprawling, vertically scrolling cityscape, battling relentless waves of robotic enemies and dodging deadly obstacles. The game draws inspiration from classic pinball, incorporating elements like ramps, targets, and bonus multipliers to reward skillful play.\n\nAs a futuristic security operative, your mission is to neutralize a rogue AI network threatening the metropolis. Each level presents a unique visual style, reflecting the game’s cyberpunk aesthetic. Navigate the screen by adjusting your scanner’s trajectory, utilizing power-ups to blast through hordes of drones and evade laser grids. \n\n*008 Scanner* features intense, fast-paced gameplay, a pulsating electronic soundtrack, and impressive graphics for the Commodore 64. Master the scanner’s controls, strategize your attacks, and become the ultimate protector of the city! Prepare for a challenging and addictive experience that blends arcade action with a captivating cyberpunk narrative."
    },
